    "detailed_description": "<h1>New Chess Game!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264310/extras/66be9a9d2d654c34411465b4416015bf.avif?t=1746379889\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infernal Chess is a dark fantasy chess game set in the fiery depths of hell. Battle on a volcanic chessboard with creature-themed pieces and master strategic gameplay as you navigate the intense atmosphere of the inferno!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264310/extras/340e268c945bb5cb6d3103455b8ded6a.webp?t=1746379889\" width=612 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264310/extras/9966d67d0e4a8766f52670cbf82b0e9f.poster.avif?t=1746379889\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264310/extras/9966d67d0e4a8766f52670cbf82b0e9f.webm?t=1746379889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264310/extras/9966d67d0e4a8766f52670cbf82b0e9f.mp4?t=1746379889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Infernal Chess</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infernal Chess is a dark fantasy twist on the classic game of chess, set against a backdrop of a fiery volcanic landscape deep in the heart of hell. Engage in strategic battles on a unique 3D chessboard, where every move is enhanced by the eerie ambiance and dramatic creature-themed pieces that bring the infernal world to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264310/extras/541fa00402c79bfb405bcf348ed2e86f.webp?t=1746379889\" width=612 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264310/extras/e6ec957ca84215732ddf73c7e15a6a2a.poster.avif?t=1746379889\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264310/extras/e6ec957ca84215732ddf73c7e15a6a2a.webm?t=1746379889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264310/extras/e6ec957ca84215732ddf73c7e15a6a2a.mp4?t=1746379889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a visually stunning experience, combining traditional chess mechanics with a rich and immersive dark fantasy setting. Whether you're a seasoned chess player or new to the game, Infernal Chess challenges you to outwit your opponents in a realm where strategy meets atmosphere.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infernal Chess is a dark fantasy chess game set in the fiery depths of hell. Battle on a volcanic chessboard with creature-themed pieces and master strategic gameplay as you navigate the intense atmosphere of the inferno!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264310/extras/340e268c945bb5cb6d3103455b8ded6a.webp?t=1746379889\" width=612 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264310/extras/9966d67d0e4a8766f52670cbf82b0e9f.poster.avif?t=1746379889\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264310/extras/9966d67d0e4a8766f52670cbf82b0e9f.webm?t=1746379889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264310/extras/9966d67d0e4a8766f52670cbf82b0e9f.mp4?t=1746379889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Infernal Chess</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infernal Chess is a dark fantasy twist on the classic game of chess, set against a backdrop of a fiery volcanic landscape deep in the heart of hell. Engage in strategic battles on a unique 3D chessboard, where every move is enhanced by the eerie ambiance and dramatic creature-themed pieces that bring the infernal world to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264310/extras/541fa00402c79bfb405bcf348ed2e86f.webp?t=1746379889\" width=612 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264310/extras/e6ec957ca84215732ddf73c7e15a6a2a.poster.avif?t=1746379889\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264310/extras/e6ec957ca84215732ddf73c7e15a6a2a.webm?t=1746379889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264310/extras/e6ec957ca84215732ddf73c7e15a6a2a.mp4?t=1746379889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a visually stunning experience, combining traditional chess mechanics with a rich and immersive dark fantasy setting. Whether you're a seasoned chess player or new to the game, Infernal Chess challenges you to outwit your opponents in a realm where strategy meets atmosphere.</p>",
